{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43474","headline":"落日山照曜 · 无名氏","name":"落日山照曜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"裴回空山下，晼晚残阳落。\n圆影过峰峦，半规入林薄。\n余光澈羣岫，乱彩分重壑。\n石镜共澄明，岩光同照灼。\n栖禽去杳杳，夕烟生漠漠。\n此境谁复知，独怀谢康乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}